<ul>
<li>[ ] Ensure invoice抬头 (company name) matches your registered entity to avoid报销 rejections.</li>
<li>[ ] Flag any invoice-to-spend discrepancies exceeding 1%—investigate potential exchange rate adjustments or platform credits.</li>
<li>[ ] Download e-invoices promptly and use consistent naming: <code>Platform_AccountID_Month_InvoiceNumber.pdf</code>.</li>
<li>[ ] Scan paper invoices upon receipt and maintain an internal invoice archive (date, platform, amount, invoice number).</li>
</ul>
