<h2>FAQ: Common Reconciliation Issues</h2>
<p><strong>Q: What if platform spend doesn't match backend data?</strong><br />
A: Use the platform billing page's final settlement amount as authoritative. Real-time backend data may show minor differences due to timezone or exchange rate calculation methods—discrepancies within 1% are typically acceptable.</p>
<p><strong>Q: How do I quickly identify which account has low balance when managing multiple accounts?</strong><br />
A: Set up account balance alerts (notify when balance falls below 3 days' worth of spend) or use multi-account management tools for automatic monitoring.</p>
<p><strong>Q: How do I handle rejected invoice applications?</strong><br />
A: Common rejection reasons include incorrect company name, mismatched tax ID, or application timeout. Review company information on the invoice request page or contact platform account manager for specific rejection reasons before resubmitting.</p>
